            "description_html": "<b>Latch Bolt for Baldwin Knob Sets</b>\r\n<p>\r\nLatch Bolts are for use with Baldwin Images interior knob sets.  Available in Passage (Hall/Closet) or Privacy (Bed/Bath) function and in 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" backset.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b> Specifications of Baldwin 549x Latch Bolts</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch Bolts have a 0437\" (11mm) throw</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolts are reversible with fixed fronts</li>\r\n<li>Can be used on beveled doors</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 1\" (25mm) face plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
